<mjml>
  <mj-body background-color="#fafbfc">
    <mj-section background-color="#fff" padding="40px 20px">
      <mj-column vertical-align="middle" width="100%">
        <mj-text align="center" padding="35px" font-size="20px" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#333">{{ project_name }} - We could not take your payment</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="16px" padding-left="25px" padding-right="25px" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#555">Hello {{ username }}</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="16px" padding-left="25px" padding-right="25px" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#555">We tried to charge {{ amount_due }} for your <strong>{{ plan_name }}</strong> plan and the payment did not go through.</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="16px" padding-left="25px" padding-right="25px" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#555"><strong>Nothing has changed yet.</strong> Your plan is working normally and all your data is intact. You have <strong>{{ days_remaining }} day(s)</strong> to update your payment details &mdash; until {{ grace_expires_at }}.</mj-text>
        <mj-button align="center" font-size="18px" background-color="#e07000" border-radius="8px" color="#fff" href="{{ billing_url }}" padding="15px 30px">Update payment method</mj-button>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="16px" padding-left="25px" padding-right="25px" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#555">If we still cannot take payment by then, the account moves to the Free plan limits. We will not delete anything, and paying at any point puts your plan straight back.</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="16px" padding-left="25px" padding-right="25px" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#555"><a href="{{ invoice_url }}">View the invoice</a></mj-text>
        <mj-divider border-color="#ccc" border-width="2px"></mj-divider>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="14px" padding-left="25px" padding-right="25px" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#555">You are receiving this because you have a {{ project_name }} account. Manage your plan any time from your <a href="{{ billing_url }}">billing page</a>.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
